# Improvisation Capstone: the spells are cast as it resolves, so timing restrictions by type are ignored (ruling). A creature
# (Llanowar Elves) and a sorcery (Duress) are cast while the Capstone resolves, with the stack holding the Capstone's own
# resolution, and resolve afterwards: the Elves are on the battlefield, and Duress takes the Lightning Bolt from Bot2's hand.

